sequenceDiagram
  participant S as LSP Server
  participant P as Proxy
  participant C as InterceptorChain
  participant D as DiagnosticsCompressor
  participant C2 as Client

  S->>P: textDocument/publishDiagnostics (raw JSON)
  P->>P: parse Content-Length frame, extract method + params
  P->>C: process("publishDiagnostics", params, ServerToClient)

  C->>D: applies_to("publishDiagnostics", ServerToClient)?
  D-->>C: true

  C->>D: intercept(params)
  alt Success
    D-->>C: Ok(Some(compacted_params))
    C-->>P: Ok(Some(compacted_params))
    P->>C2: compacted JSON-RPC response
  else Error
    D-->>C: Err(warn log "failed, forwarding original")
    C-->>P: Ok(original_params)
    P->>C2: original JSON-RPC response (fail-open)
  end
